  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Millennium Village (Phase II) Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program aims at accelerating the achievement of the MDGs through targeted multisector interventions in the areas of (i) agriculture production and nutrition, (ii) Microfinance and business development, (iii) Access to quality education, (iv) Improving access to basic healthcare, and (v) Access to water for household needs.</narrative>
